      "summaryMarkdown": "All eight criteria hold:\n\n- **Bundled text:** a deterministic Cosmic Text system with no system fonts, behind `test-support`; `NoopTextSystem` stays the default.\n- **Executor clock:** every listed motion module reads `BackgroundExecutor::now()`. Production clocks are unchanged, and Zed's recognizer changed only its time source.\n- **Input simulation:** goes through `dispatch_event` and the input handler, with recorded platform/window calls and window options.\n- **Locators:** read only public snapshot data and pass in release mode.\n\nThe three minor findings from the first pass are repaired and verified in the delta: a tolerance for the libm-dependent fling offset, documented and tested inactive-window frame throttling, and a spec that records that gpui has no scrollbar timer.",
